<blockquote class="uncited"><div><img src="https://www.opengd77.com/download/file.php?id=1492" class="postimage" alt="Image"></div></blockquote>The problem with one of my radios is that the adhesive holding the antenna let go so the antenna was not pointing up.  I fixed that with some hot glue, set my laptop to the exact correct time, uploaded the satellite keps to set the radio clock exact and it got its first GPS fix rather quickly.  Prior to that it would see only one satellite and then maybe two for a split second before going back to one or no satellites.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=5311">KZ4DT</a> — Tue Aug 27, 2024 9:52 pm</p><hr />
