The internal antenna in the md9600 does not have an amplifier, and so does not need a power supply. <br>You are correct, if you were to fit an amplified antenna then you would need to feed 3.3v into pin 14 of the GPS module.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Thu Oct 20, 2022 11:03 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
